Phase 885: Medicinal Plant & Dye Administration Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/ibota_admin/src/main.c (Ibota Wax Privet Administration)
   - Base ID: 2081
   - Manages ibota (Ligustrum ibota/wax privet) ornamental and medicinal cultivation
   - Features: shrub inventory (16 plants), leaf harvest tracking, wax production monitoring, medicinal extract preparation, pruning schedule, pest management, propagation records, landscape use catalog
   - Domain structs: ibota_t (id, plant_id, age_years, leaf_kg, wax_kg, extract_conc, prune_month, pest_level, propagate_type, landscape_use, active)
   - Functions: ibota_init, ibota_plant_inventory, ibota_leaf_harvest, ibota_wax_extract, ibota_medicinal_prep, ibota_prune_schedule, ibota_pest_manage, ibota_propagate
   - Exports: main (demo: plant inventory, leaf harvest, wax extraction, medicinal prep, pruning, pest management, propagation)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style (host imports: alloc/print/exit/get_argv, ps/pi helpers, static state, N=16)

2. modules/illicium_admin/src/main.c (Illicium Star Anise Administration)
   - Base ID: 2082
   - Manages illicium (star anise) spice and medicinal production
   - Features: tree inventory (16 trees), fruit harvest tracking, shikimic acid content analysis, essential oil distillation records, spice grading (culinary/medicinal/pharmaceutical), quality control (GC-MS), organic certification, market distribution tracking
   - Domain structs: illicium_t (id, tree_id, age_years, fruit_kg, shikimic_ppm, oil_ml, grade, gcms_ok, organic_cert, market_region, active)
   - Functions: illicium_init, illicium_tree_inventory, illicium_fruit_harvest, illicium_shikimic_analyze, illicium_oil_distill, illicium_grade, illicium_quality_control, illicium_organic_cert
   - Exports: main (demo: tree inventory, fruit harvest, shikimic acid analysis, oil distillation, grading, QC, organic cert)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/indigofera_admin/src/main.c (Indigofera Dye Plant Administration)
   - Base ID: 2083
   - Manages indigofera (indigo plant) dye production
   - Features: field cultivation (16 plots), leaf harvest cycles, indigo precursor (indican) content tracking, fermentation process records, dye cake production, color intensity measurement (spectrophotometry), textile application tracking, historical dye recipe catalog
   - Domain structs: indigo_t (id, plot_id, growth_day, leaf_kg, indican_ppm, ferment_day, dye_cake_g, color_intensity, textile_type, recipe_id, active)
   - Functions: indigo_init, indigo_plot_establish, indigo_leaf_harvest, indigo_indican_track, indigo_ferment, indigo_dye_cake_produce, indigo_color_measure, indigo_textile_apply
   - Exports: main (demo: plot establishment, leaf harvest, indican tracking, fermentation, dye cake production, color measurement, textile application)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

